#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:13 806885e88e17419f92587e4e4f4d3792
msgid ""
"The mLRS project is open source firmware which implements a long range "
"integrated RC and full MAVLink telemetry system which can run on a few off "
"the shelf and DIY hardware platforms.  It supports 433 MHz, 868/915 MHz, and"
" 2.4 GHz bands.  It is capable of reaching ranges of 7 to 87 km in LoRa "
"modes, depending on the message rate, output power, and frequency band "
"supported by the chosen hardware.  A MAVLink ground station (phone or PC) "
"may be connected to the transmitter module via USB, serial, WiFi or "
"Bluetooth depending on the hardware selected."
msgstr ""
"mLRS 项目是一个开源固件，实现了长距离集成 RC 与完整 MAVLink 数传系统，可在少数现成和 DIY 硬件平台上运行。它支持 433 "
"MHz、868/915 MHz 和 2.4 GHz 频段。在 LoRa 模式下，根据所选硬件支持的消息速率、输出功率和频段，通信距离可达 7 至 87 "
"公里。MAVLink 地面站（手机或电脑）可通过 USB、串口、WiFi 或蓝牙连接到发射模块（取决于所选硬件）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:13
#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:15 06bf54b560f740558a6d8850059224ca
#: 2264a789e75140d3a2740433e87b279d 72d1ebcdb7394d79a9b971a7d875db63
#: 8feb2c2afa294719b644bc188cdba8cb ce6ec32ed7724e09be4605e7aba83c4e
#: d522fc563f7a46beaa7b880ae9b4b042
msgid ""
"When the CRSF protocol is used for RC data on EdgeTX/OpenTX based radios, "
"mLRS also translates some common MAVLink messages into telemetry sensors "
"which can be used by the Yaapu Telemetry App as described `here "
"<https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-docu/blob/master/docs/CRSF.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"当在基于 EdgeTX/OpenTX 的遥控器上使用 CRSF 协议传输 RC 数据时，mLRS 还会将部分常见 MAVLink "
"消息转换为数传传感器数据，供 Yaapu Telemetry App 使用，详见 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-docu/blob/master/docs/CRSF.md>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:19 466ed4ac928a451880a16c6ee6e542e2
msgid ""
"The receivers can output RC controls in either SBUS or CRSF(including link "
"quality info) to the autopilot or use embedded MAVLink overrides via only "
"the telemetry connection to the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"接收机可以向飞控输出 SBUS 或 CRSF（包括链路质量信息）格式的 RC 控制信号，也可以通过与飞控的数传连接使用嵌入式 MAVLink 覆盖。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:21 3393da9b174a4f05bf282f0161b6fee8
msgid ""
"mLRS has been optimized for use with ArduPilot and includes specific support"
" for MAVLink including flow control via RADIO_STATUS messages and optional "
"injection of RC_CHANNELS_OVERRIDE messages allowing a single full duplex "
"serial connection to the flight controller for both RC and MAVLink."
msgstr ""
"mLRS 已针对 ArduPilot 进行了优化，包含对 MAVLink 的特殊支持，例如通过 RADIO_STATUS 消息进行流量控制，以及可选的 "
"RC_CHANNELS_OVERRIDE 消息注入，从而只需一个全双工串行连接到飞控即可同时传输 RC 和 MAVLink 数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:23 5263a0ed18384ae9ac2e528a1e1fdb63
msgid ""
"mLRS is rich in features including support for full diversity, 10 model "
"configurations, and OLED display or LUA script for configuration."
msgstr "mLRS 功能丰富，支持完整分集、10 种模型配置，以及用于配置的 OLED 显示屏或 LUA 脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:25 ead6caf5d9c842f486f8cd2243bd382e
msgid ""
"You can install the mLRS firmware on one of the supported off the shelf "
"hardware platforms which currently includes the `R9M Tx module "
"<https://www.frsky-rc.com/product/r9m-2019/>`__, `R9MX Rx "
"<https://www.frsky-rc.com/product/r9m-2019/>`__, and R9MM at 868/915 MHz and"
" the `FRM303 Rx/Tx module <https://www.flysky-cn.com/frm303description>`__ "
"at 2.4 GHz."
msgstr ""
"你可以在受支持的现成硬件平台上安装 mLRS 固件，目前包括 `R9M 发射模块 <https://www.frsky-"
"rc.com/product/r9m-2019/>`__、`R9MX 接收机 <https://www.frsky-"
"rc.com/product/r9m-2019/>`__ （868/915 MHz 的 R9MM）以及 `FRM303 收发模块 "
"<https://www.flysky-cn.com/frm303description>`__ （2.4 GHz）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:27 cd28312a96a948f99522e49c9fc8c6c0
msgid ""
"See the mLRS documentation for the `FrSky R9 "
"<https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-docu/blob/master/docs/FRSKY_R9.md>`__ or "
"`Flysky FRM303 <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/master/docs/FLYSKY_FRM303.md>`__ for instructions on flashing the "
"firmware."
msgstr ""
"关于刷写固件的说明，请参阅 mLRS 文档中的 `FrSky R9 <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/master/docs/FRSKY_R9.md>`__ 或 `Flysky FRM303 "
"<https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-docu/blob/master/docs/FLYSKY_FRM303.md>`__ "
"部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:29 9c9462a9a9b94ce49f7bf07d7cd39d2a
msgid ""
"Or, with some soldering skill, you can build one of the DIY board designs "
"which are documented on the  `Github <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"hardware>`__ and the `mLRS documentation <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/master/README.md>`__"
msgstr ""
"或者，具备一定焊接技能后，你也可以制作 DIY 板卡设计，相关文档见 `Github <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"hardware>`__ 和 `mLRS 文档 <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/master/README.md>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:33 03346754f8e14828bed6be7c9f20bd67
msgid ""
"FrSky R9M Tx module with `M5Stamp pico "
"<https://shop.m5stack.com/products/m5stamp-pico-diy-kit>`__ piggyback "
"`Wireless Bridge <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/master/docs/WIRELESS_BRIDGE.md>`__ for Bluetooth or WiFi to GCS "
"pictured with light weight dipole and R9MX receiver"
msgstr ""
"FrSky R9M 发射模块搭配 `M5Stamp pico <https://shop.m5stack.com/products/m5stamp-"
"pico-diy-kit>`__ 背板 `无线桥接 <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/master/docs/WIRELESS_BRIDGE.md>`__，支持蓝牙或 WiFi 连接地面站，图中配有轻量级偶极天线和 "
"R9MX 接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:11 2585ccbf05de4aa88004e2410437aa2d
#: 619d6d43bcce446d93a54b2f5a5d7b82 981f13fedc3149b4b124e2f8e2613e6f
#: 9facbe3281844afd80dfdffbced9cc4e ad0e9307d53f41ceb572a78bd10291e4
msgid ""
"The mLRS project is open source firmware which provides long range "
"traditional RC and a full MAVLink, MSP, or serial bi-directional telemetry "
"connection using a single radio link.  The mLRS firmware can run on several "
"off-the-shelf and DIY radio hardware platforms.  It supports 433 MHz, "
"868/915 MHz, and 2.4 GHz bands.  It is capable of reaching ranges of 7 to 87"
" km in LoRa modes, depending on the message rate, output power, and "
"frequency band supported by the chosen hardware.  One user reported a range "
"of 143 km on 433 MHz band.  A MAVLink ground station (phone, tablet or PC) "
"may be connected to the mLRS Tx module via USB, serial, `WiFi "
"<https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-docu/blob/main/docs/WIRELESS_BRIDGE.md>`__,"
" :ref:`Bluetooth SPP <common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity>` or BLE"
" depending on the hardware selected."
msgstr ""
"mLRS 项目是一个开源固件，仅用单条无线电链路即可提供远距离传统 RC 控制以及完整的 MAVLink、MSP 或串行双向数传连接。mLRS "
"固件可运行在多种现成及 DIY 无线电硬件平台上。它支持 433 MHz、868/915 MHz 和 2.4 GHz 频段。在 LoRa 模式下可达到 "
"7 至 87 km 的距离，具体取决于所选硬件支持的消息速率、输出功率和频段。有用户报告在 433 MHz 频段达到了 143 km。MAVLink "
"地面站（手机、平板或 PC）可通过 USB、串口、`WiFi <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/main/docs/WIRELESS_BRIDGE.md>`__、:ref:`Bluetooth SPP <common-"
"mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity>` 或 BLE 连接到 mLRS Tx 模块，视所选硬件而定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:17 15b232d7add34547a74f5c35cc383ec1
#: 23090236f14b49b98f22118483c926e3 616267e46ce14cf8aa4c4400213a3bde
#: 99eb3f31c2c14941a29c8b5669ae6440 ce184fb9b2ac47a6bc6d5042606c58ee
msgid ""
"The mLRS receiver can output RC channels to the autopilot via either SBUS or"
" CRSF (including link quality info).  Or it can be configured to use "
"embedded injection of RC_CHANNELS_OVERRIDE or RADIO_RC_CHANNELS MAVLink "
"messages via only the telemetry connection to the autopilot, reducing the "
"number of serial ports and wires required.  DroneCAN, carrying both RC "
"channels and full MAVLink, is also supported by some receivers."
msgstr ""
"mLRS 接收机可通过 SBUS 或 CRSF（含链路质量信息）向飞控输出 RC 通道。也可以将其配置为仅通过与飞控的数传连接，以嵌入注入 "
"RC_CHANNELS_OVERRIDE 或 RADIO_RC_CHANNELS MAVLink "
"消息的方式传输，从而减少所需的串口和线缆数量。部分接收机还支持 DroneCAN，可同时承载 RC 通道和完整的 MAVLink。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:19 5e01913d95804434947aa6c8cad63f7f
#: 6cefb0eb6d384b6f9f15bcad94fa6d22 7dd129dd30cc4653b0de1eb89f1b5058
#: ada6e9c113c840199562fce85710b01c cd1187fe1a224227b7734c89a81cdd8e
msgid ""
"mLRS has been optimized for use with ArduPilot and includes specific support"
" for MAVLink.  This includes flow control and RSSI via RADIO_STATUS "
"messages, flashing receivers via ArduPilot passthrough, and the use of "
"MAVLink parameters for ground station management of mLRS radio "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"mLRS 已针对 ArduPilot 优化，并包含对 MAVLink 的专门支持。这包括通过 RADIO_STATUS 消息实现流控和 RSSI、通过 "
"ArduPilot 直通（passthrough）刷写接收机，以及使用 MAVLink 参数由地面站管理 mLRS 电台配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:21 3291f0f0b65b4232ac99d481b505aeb9
#: 44f8d04b8937452cadd08326861642de 7e76a2eab6164de0b8cfd9bd3212594c
#: b07aa07b288541ce8ffb032f0c5b98ae df3a04a0781842e39cf73d2b5c9dd74f
msgid ""
"mLRS is rich in features; including support for full diversity, dual band, "
"RC channel control of RF power, 10 model configurations, and radio "
"configuration via OLED display, LUA script, CLI, or MAVLink Parameters.  See"
" the `Project Status summary "
"<https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS/blob/main/README.md#project-status>`__ for "
"a more complete list of features."
msgstr ""
"mLRS 功能丰富；包括支持完整分集、双频段、用 RC 通道控制射频功率、10 组模型配置，以及通过 OLED 显示屏、LUA 脚本、CLI 或 "
"MAVLink 参数进行电台配置。更完整的功能列表参见 `Project Status summary "
"<https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS/blob/main/README.md#project-status>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:23 4f60fbe9e5f24c3f9577a36f2ed8670e
#: 553a4086134d45f68553464f2a3b8876 8253cc50b5624556bfed429f662c0e7c
#: 906f14a90ac44e3fb80db54a72167724 c6f52d61d4be4cc38517f10aae6cca03
msgid ""
"Using the `mLRS Web Flasher App <https://olliw.eu/mlrsflasher>`__ is the "
"easiest way to `install the mLRS firmware <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/main/docs/FLASHING.md>`__ on one of the many readily available "
"off-the-shelf hardware platforms."
msgstr ""
"使用 `mLRS Web Flasher App <https://olliw.eu/mlrsflasher>`__ 是在众多现成硬件平台之一上 `安装"
" mLRS 固件 <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/main/docs/FLASHING.md>`__ 的最简便方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:25 0bd36b1709fc42d79198c9b2967516ac
#: 36538745c5f6426d9d8b5c4bda30cdd6 6e336924756a4530b39b7cc01c979c84
#: b09ce5d2d3b040d3a7195baeb111406b bb5381bc7b414837a836aa135f388555
msgid ""
"Off-the-shelf options include `MatekSys mLRS Tx modules and receivers "
"<https://www.mateksys.com/?page_id=12174>`__, most `internal ELRS Tx modules"
" <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/main/docs/ELRS_TX_MODULES.md#internal-tx-modules>`__ integrated "
"into many modern EdgeTX RC radio handsets, a wide selection of the most "
"popular `ELRS external Tx modules <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/main/docs/ELRS_TX_MODULES.md#external-tx-modules>`__, many `ELRS "
"receivers <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/main/docs/ELRS_RECEIVERS.md>`__, generic integrated UART type ELRS"
" receivers found in many all-in-one flight controllers, and some `FrSky R9 "
"devices <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/main/docs/FRSKY_R9.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"现成的选择包括 `MatekSys mLRS Tx 模块和接收机 "
"<https://www.mateksys.com/?page_id=12174>`__、集成于许多现代 EdgeTX 遥控器中的大多数 `内置 "
"ELRS Tx 模块 <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/main/docs/ELRS_TX_MODULES.md#internal-tx-modules>`__、多款最流行的 `ELRS "
"外置 Tx 模块 <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/main/docs/ELRS_TX_MODULES.md#external-tx-modules>`__、许多 `ELRS 接收机 "
"<https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/main/docs/ELRS_RECEIVERS.md>`__、许多一体化飞控中常见的通用 UART 型集成 ELRS "
"接收机，以及部分 `FrSky R9 设备 <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/main/docs/FRSKY_R9.md>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:27 3ce81e28e3644987ba3cbe20c52e7d9f
#: 4b8ff64a86914384b45626f127dcdf1c a39c169e51874352b3ae9f3a83c6cabf
#: a5cf85d68da44306b86e7080598d8c31 d8341d3c86df44a6bb6822f2b2c19ba6
msgid ""
"Or, with some soldering skill, you can build one of the DIY board designs "
"which are documented on the  `Github mLRS-hardware page "
"<https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-hardware>`__ and the `mLRS documentation "
"<https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-docu/blob/master/README.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"或者，只要有一定的焊接技能，你也可以制作 DIY 板方案之一，相关设计记录在 `Github mLRS-hardware 页面 "
"<https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-hardware>`__ 和 `mLRS 文档 "
"<https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-docu/blob/master/README.md>`__ 中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:29 071611dc9cc7431782dda20d3ff14c30
#: 208ab33a1cf2428c9d39ae481c6afa54 5a500d1bbbe3454c804c203fe464082e
#: ae288a3085cc4992ba8c156d3bba3d79 bd5de0973d1843e3862a355514c76291
msgid ""
"See the `mLRS documentation <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/main/README.md>`__ for details on supported hardware."
msgstr ""
"有关支持硬件的详情，参见 `mLRS 文档 <https://github.com/olliw42/mLRS-"
"docu/blob/main/README.md>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mlrs-rc.rst:33 3c882f91ecd94975b766c4d7a07e13ae
#: 58048f2f47ac439a8b0e3751dceb3568 d23743eff8074ed0bf5612c62d0c5be9
#: d7576adbc02c4913bd2da00a7991e149 fa179846659e4248b0bc462ec65cfbc1
msgid ""
"A sample collection of off-the-shelf Tx modules, receivers, and all-in-one "
"flight controllers supported by mLRS, including some RC handsets with "
"supported internal Tx modules"
msgstr "mLRS 支持的现成 Tx 模块、接收机和一体化飞控示例集合，包括部分带受支持内置 Tx 模块的遥控器"
